' -X POST localhost:4000/v1/messages -H 'content-type: application/json' -H 'authorization: Bearer sk-1234' -H 'x-claude-code-session-id: 3f4e1a2b-1111-4222-8333-444455556666' -d '{"model":"anthropic-haiku-4-5","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"say messages"}],"max_tokens":5}'` -> `HTTP 200` 2. LangSmith received `{"id": "bd87f2fe-...", "trace_id": "3f4e1a2b-1111-4222-8333-444455556666", "dotted_order": "20260820T195836717580Zbd87f2fe-...", "parent_run_id": null}` and answered `400 ... does not match first part of dotted_order bd87f2fe-...` #### POST /v1/responses with x-litellm-trace-id 1. `curl -s -o /dev/null -w 'HTTP %{http_code}
